Package: learnrTrackR
Title: Track Simulated learnr Tutorial Attempts
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Aurélien", "Nicosia", , "116816597+AurelienNicosiaULaval@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a minimal SQLite storage layer for simulated tutorial
    attempts. The package records submitted answers, attempt metadata, simple
    grading outcomes, score summaries, and CSV exports for early prototyping of
    tracked learnr-style teaching workflows.
